# Helm chart templates are Go text/template, not YAML. `{{ include ... }}` in a
# value position is a syntax error to any YAML parser, so Prettier cannot check
# these files -- it exits non-zero with a parse error rather than a style
# warning, which fails the CI static job outright. `helm lint` is the right
# gate for these.
infra/helm/**/templates/

# Generated by `pnpm --filter @vims/ui tokens:build`. A generated file must match
# its generator byte for byte -- tokens.spec.ts asserts exactly that -- so
# reformatting it here would make the committed CSS disagree with the code that
# produces it, and the next regeneration would revert whatever Prettier did.
packages/ui/src/tokens/theme.generated.css
